WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.535
Everyone knows style
when they see it,

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.370
but sometimes good style
gets overlooked.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.973
Not anymore. It's time for
"I Like Your Style."

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.708
-♪ I like your style ♪

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:11.111
♪♪

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:12.945
♪ I like your style ♪

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:15.949
-[ Deep voice ] Hey, menu on
the side of the ice cream truck,

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:17.616
I like your style.

00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:19.586
I didn't even know they made
Jell-O Pudding Pops anymore,

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.420
but according to that
sun-bleached sticker

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.788
between the Bugs Bunny bar

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:25.225
and the pineapple sundae
no one has ever ordered,

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:27.026
looks like today's
throwback Thursday

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:31.130
for my tongue...tasty style.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.933
Hey, seasonal aisle
at the supermarket,

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.501
I like your style.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.470
Who wouldn't want to buy
a bathing suit off the rack

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.939
that's 10 feet away
from a deli slicer?

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.807
You got it all,
by which I mean

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:43.576
the exact same American flag
beach chair

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:45.277
I broke last summer.

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:47.747
Next time I need a boogie board
and a citronella candle

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.315
and a metal bucket
with three wicks,

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:50.983
I know right where I'm headed.

00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:53.052
Style alert in aisle 3.

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:54.720
♪♪

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.823
Hi, roadside
fireworks tents,

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.524
I like your style.

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:00.426
Whenever I'm cruising down
the exit ramp

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:02.928
and see a structure usually
occupied by circus clowns,

00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:04.697
I say to myself, "Ooh,

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.767
time to buy some explosives
from a 17-year-old."

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.535
No need for sparklers, though.

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:12.972
'Cause your style
lights up the night.

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:16.476
Hey, gas station DVD rack,
I like your style.

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:18.912
It's like you already know
there's no Wi-Fi up at the lake

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.414
the Scrabble set's
missing all the vowels.

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.682
I especially love those DVDs
named something like

00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:25.117
"The Susan Sarandon Collection"

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:26.519
that comes with
"Thelma &amp; Louise"

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:29.188
and three other movies even
Susan Sarandon's never heard of.

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:31.157
And, hey, no need for a case.

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:34.093
I'll just take those loose discs
in an unmarked paper sleeve,

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:36.762
scratchy style.

00:01:36.762 --> 00:01:39.598
Hey, grill warming rack,
I like your style.

00:01:39.598 --> 00:01:42.668
You're like a little private
balcony for my hot dog buns.

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:44.871
Or, hey, if my vegan buddy
doesn't want his kabobs

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.140
near the steak, that skewer
can post up there

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.408
like Evita looking down
on her subjects.

00:01:49.408 --> 00:01:52.679
Don't cry for her. There's
plenty of style to go around.

00:01:55.314 --> 00:01:57.683
[ Skateboard thuds ]

00:01:57.683 --> 00:02:00.486
Hey, GPS device that comes
with the rental car,

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:02.254
I like your style.

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:03.556
You're classic, you know.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.024
'Cause who needs Waze
when you've got

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:07.293
a 2005 edition of Rand McNally
loaded up

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.361
and a Home Depot scanner gun?

00:02:09.361 --> 00:02:11.130
Some electronics get
smaller and smaller

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:13.132
as time goes by, but not you.

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:15.201
You're just a chunky little
TV/VCR combo

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.036
right in the middle
of the windshield,

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:20.907
and you've got
style for miles.

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:22.508
That's all of this week's style.

00:02:22.508 --> 00:02:24.410
We'll be right back
with Charlize Theron.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.080
Don't go away.
♪♪

